/boot/firmware/cmdline.txt is a single line. install.sh makes sure it contains:

  quiet fastboot modules-load=dwc2

and removes any "console=serial0,115200" / "console=ttyAMA0,115200" entry (no serial
console). Everything else (root=PARTUUID=..., rootfstype, rootwait, cfg80211.ieee80211_regdom=...)
is left untouched. If the Pi will not boot after a manual edit, put the card in a
laptop and restore the single-line original.
